# Invisible ball: Broken Trace on SERVING between U43 pin 10 and U38 pin 10 (3B), the last stretch of
# its route from U41; the OR input floats high, so BALLV_N is always high and the ball is never drawn.
# The game goes on unseen (U43 still gets SERVING).
machine tennis
title "Invisible ball"
brief "There is no ball, yet the scores keep going up."
fault crack U43.3B U38.3B 50%
